"""NVIDIA device ID → architecture → driver branch / CUDA / PyTorch backend.

Facts (2026-09): R595 is the production branch for Turing and newer; Blackwell (RTX 50) needs the
open kernel modules. R580 is the last branch for Maxwell/Pascal/Volta (legacy). CUDA 13.x needs
driver ≥ 580 *and* Turing+; older GPUs stay on CUDA 12.x (PyTorch ``cu126`` wheels).
``uv --torch-backend=auto`` ignores the GPU generation (uv #14742), so svoya decides itself.
"""
